Firecrawl example
-----------------

hello_firecrawl.py is a tiny, self-contained example that runs a web search
with Firecrawl and prints the top results -- a "Hello World" for web search.

Setup:

    pip install -r requirements.txt
    cp .env.example .env        # then add your FIRECRAWL_API_KEY

Run:

    export FIRECRAWL_API_KEY="fc-..."
    python hello_firecrawl.py [QUERY...]   # defaults to "what is Firecrawl"

Get a free API key and read the docs at https://docs.firecrawl.dev
